{
  "id": "E387",
  "title": "I'll Eat Whatever",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2019-12-24",
  "synopsis": "Little Le is going to make some sandwiches for tomorrow. What kind of sandwich does Paul like?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50387/082544649fc6e2994cc2bb516e2001817425367b.mp3?1576959340",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你做什么我就吃什么\n\n小乐：你喜欢吃什么三明治？我要做几个明天吃。\n保罗：太好了！我要金枪鱼三明治。\n小乐：我们没有金枪鱼。\n保罗：那我要鸡蛋火腿三明治。\n小乐：鸡蛋有，火腿没有。\n保罗：算了，你做什么我就吃什么吧。\n",
    "traditional": "你做什麼我就吃什麼\n\n小樂：你喜歡吃什麼三明治？我要做幾個明天吃。\n保羅：太好了！我要金槍魚三明治。\n小樂：我們沒有金槍魚。\n保羅：那我要雞蛋火腿三明治。\n小樂：雞蛋有，火腿沒有。\n保羅：算了，你做什麼我就吃什麼吧。\n"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I’ll Eat Whatever You Make"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小乐：你喜欢吃什么三明治？我要做几个明天吃。",
      "traditional": "小樂：你喜歡吃什麼三明治？我要做幾個明天吃。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè nǐ xǐ huan chī shén me sān míng zhì wǒ yào zuò jǐ ge míng tiān chī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: What kind of sandwich do you like? I’m going to make a few sandwiches to eat tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "保罗：太好了！我要金枪鱼三明治。",
      "traditional": "保羅：太好了！我要金槍魚三明治。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó tài hǎo le wǒ yào jīn qiāng yú sān míng zhì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Great! I want a tuna sandwich."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小乐：我们没有金枪鱼。",
      "traditional": "小樂：我們沒有金槍魚。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè wǒ men méi yǒu jīn qiāng yú",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: We don’t have tuna."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "保罗：那我要鸡蛋火腿三明治。",
      "traditional": "保羅：那我要雞蛋火腿三明治。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó nà wǒ yào jī dàn huǒ tuǐ sān míng zhì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Then I want an egg and ham sandwich."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小乐：鸡蛋有，火腿没有。",
      "traditional": "小樂：雞蛋有，火腿沒有。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè jī dàn yǒu huǒ tuǐ méi yǒu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le:  We have eggs, but no ham."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "保罗：算了，你做什么我就吃什么吧。",
      "traditional": "保羅：算了，你做什麼我就吃什麼吧。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó suàn le nǐ zuò shén me wǒ jiù chī shén me ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Never mind,  I’ll eat whatever you make."
    }
  ],
